#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/restart_syscall.2:17
msgid ""
"restart_syscall - restart a system call after interruption by a stop signal"
msgstr ""
"restart_syscall - 一時停止シグナルによる割り込み後にシステムコールを再開する"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/restart_syscall.2:20
