"I<ss> が NULL 以外で、I<ss_flags> フィールドが無効なフラグを含んでいる。"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/sigaltstack.2:223
msgid ""
"The specified size of the new alternate signal stack I<ss.ss_size> was less "
"than B<MINSIGSTKSZ>."
