"indicates that the signal is described in the original POSIX.1-1990 "
"standard; \"P2001\" indicates that the signal was added or its definition "
"changed in SUSv2 and POSIX.1-2001.  \"P2024\" indicates that the signal was "
"added or its definition changed in POSIX.1-2024."
