"B<sigemptyset>(),\n"
"B<sigfillset>(),\n"
"B<sigaddset>(),\n"
"B<sigdelset>(),\n"
"B<sigismember>(),\n"
"B<sigisemptyset>(),\n"
"B<sigorset>(),\n"
"B<sigandset>()"
msgstr "B<sigemptyset>(), B<sigfillset>(), B<sigaddset>(), B<sigdelset>(), B<sigismember>():"

