#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/timer_create.2:195
msgid ""
"On success, B<timer_create>()  returns 0, and the ID of the new timer is "
"placed in I<*timerid>.  On failure, -1 is returned, and I<errno> is set to "
"indicate the error."
